1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:04,570
The second law is about loops: any closed path round a circuit.

2
00:00:04,570 --> 00:00:07,460
Carry a unit charge once round this loop.

3
00:00:07,460 --> 00:00:09,765
The cell lifts it up by ten volts.

4
00:00:09,765 --> 00:00:13,880
The resistors take it back down, six volts and then four.

